p.arange(64,dtype=jnp.uint8)\r\na = jax.device_put(a,sharding8)\r\n\r\ndef simple_op(a):\r\n    return a+1\r\n\r\nout = jax.vmap(simple_op)(a)\r\n\r\n```\r\n<img src=\"https://github.com/google/jax/assets/53092553/cffeb859-fa0f-4ae4-a0ba-a64999e18a17\" height=\"100\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nHowever, when I use ``jnp.uint64`` instead. I get a different result\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://github.com/google/jax/assets/53092553/59b8b60c-333e-460b-b0a0-073c78e6da0a\" height=\"100\" />\r\n\r\nThe corresponding code \r\n```python\r\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\r\na = jnp.arange(64,dtype=jnp.int64)\r\na = jax.device_put(a,sharding8)\r\nout = jax.vmap(simple_op)(a)\r\n```\r\nThis is a very strange bug. What could be the possible cause? \r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\njax==0.4.6, jaxlib==0.4.6\r\n\r\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\r\n\r\nTPU\r\n\r\n### Additional system info\r\n\r\nPython 3.8.16 (Kaggle Environment)\r\n\r\n### NVIDIA GPU info\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_at":"2023-11-03T03:48:56Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},